WEBVTT

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:03.420
Hi, I'm Bree. I help you build a strong resume.

00:00:03.920 --> 00:00:09.260
I help you pick your best skills, write clear bullet points, and keep it to one clean page.

00:00:10.160 --> 00:00:14.660
For example, ask me: turn my summer job into resume bullet points.
